  m_text: "The Chinese Government Envoys sent to central Asia returned to court speaking
    about a \"heavenly horse\" with a powerful back and shoulders that worked so
    hard, it \"sweated blood\". \n\nThe Chinese emperor at that time, Wu, became
    obsessed with these stories of the heavenly horse, he dispatched diplomats, then
    later a military force to obtain it. "
